WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.550 align:start position:0%
 
medieval legends have a way of standing  the test of time from arthurian  literature to monty python and the holy  grail the legend of the black knight has  managed to survive in countless forms  throughout the centuries typically  portrayed as a villainous mysterious  character the black knight often masks  their identity and swears fealty to no  lord or lady like other knights do under  the shroud of anonymity a black knight  will conduct many a foul deed usually  riding on the back of a shadowy steed  and ultimately defeated by their polar  opposite a righteous white knight sworn  to do good a tale as old as time these  two nights of light and dark are the  embodiment of the eternal moral struggle  between good and evil with the stock  character of the black knight commonly  being associated with death and darkness  these aren't just legends of course or  are they it has been said that every  legend is rooted somewhere in truth  while the black knight has always been a  metaphorical figure a personification of  the notion of evil could there be a real  night clad in shadow that first inspired  the myth perhaps it's time you're  acquainted with scp-5151  which might just be the original black  knight himself as the name suggests  scp-5151 is a humanoid male figure who  is originally from the medieval era he  sports chainmail armor specifically a  type called a hauberg which is chainmail  that forms a full coat or tunic and he  also wears a laurel wreath around his  head he often refers to himself as the  black knight although he also claims to  have been known by other names and  titles throughout history according to  observations made by the scp foundation  the night never requires food water or  rest in order to survive although he has  been seen to eat and drink purely for  the enjoyment of it even though he  appears to wear armor and clothing  beneath every aspect of  scp-5151's clothing and his body share  the same anomalous properties every part  of him his armor his garments and his  longsword can phase through surfaces and  objects as if the knight was incorporeal  scp-5151 also appears to be able to  alter his physical properties at will  either becoming solid or more ghost-like  when he so chooses to as you can  probably imagine the foundation has  found it somewhat difficult to contain  the black knight thanks to these  abilities  scp-5151 also possesses an extraordinary  method of attack when confronted with a  target the knight will deem whether the  person is either worthy or dishonorable  though the criteria he is judging by  seems to be his own mysterious standards  should  scp-5151 find someone to be dishonorable  he will stab them directly through their  aorta with his longsword rather than  merely dispatch them though the black  knight will then proceed to drain every  drop of blood from his target's body  until they are little more than a dry  husk this was first witnessed during the  foundation's preliminary encounter with  scp-51  alerted to reports of vigilantism taking  place across a number of french  provinces the scp foundation followed  this lead to find a trail of bodies  across el sauce lorraine champagne and  orleanae the scp foundation dispatched  one of their many mobile task forces mtf  pi-1 also known under the code name city  slickers to look into the series of  murders what they soon found was that  these slain victims were anything but  innocent being guilty of multiple  murders themselves as well as the  abduction and trafficking of 18 children  from a french orphanage during their  investigation mobile task force agents  discovered the bodies of these criminals  had been killed by exsanguination the  process of extracting all the blood from  their bodies the victims possessed  matching stab wounds that pierced their  aortas but forensic analysis uncovered  no traces of blood appearing anywhere on  their clothing acting quickly the city  slickers apprehended another man who had  been involved in the same criminal  activities as the other two victims in  the hopes of drawing the killer out into  the open by using the trafficker as bait  a plan which as it turned out would  bring scp-5151  right to them while the mobile task  force were transporting the surviving  trafficker their vehicles were halted by  figures standing directly in their path  as the city slickers hit their brakes  scp-5151  began to slowly approach them ignoring  the agent's warning not to step any  closer one operative opened fire on the  approaching entity but the conventional  arms fire had no effect on the night  with the bullets passing right through  his intangible form the foundation mtf  agents instead tried to restrain  scp-5151  only to find that they could not  physically grab him their hands simply  passing through the black knight's body  reaching his target as cp 5151  dispatched of the remaining criminal in  the same way he had killed the previous  two by stabbing his longsword directly  into the trafficker's aorta and rapidly  draining the blood from him then the  black knight turned on the operatives  that had shot at him lunging for the  foundation agent and finishing him in  the exact same way as his other victims  immediately after killing the mobile  task force agent  scp-5151 seemed to surrender sheathing  his weapon and raising his hands in  submission before offering a greeting to  the remaining members of mtf pie one  brave fellows do not worry about him i  disposed of him as i have with others of  his lot loyalty is a virtue and the lack  of it will lead to the death of chivalry  my presence is a testament that chivalry  will never die with this being said i  understand you have been searching for  me pray tell what you might need of me  the mtf agents were not about to engage  in a parlay with a ghostly knight and  they contacted command at scp foundation  site 06-3  the site director in turn dispatched dr  sylvan moreau the senior researcher at  site 06-3 to conduct an on-site  interview with scp-5151  which took place on the roadside where  the knight had confronted the mobile  task force interestingly not only did  scp-5151 seem to engage dr moreau with  respect and friendly candor but he also  appeared to be fluent in french which  the doctor conducted the interview in as  they exchanged greetings the knight was  complained with the questions posed to  him apparently respectful of mero's  position as a doctor when asked  scp-5151 explained that he had attacked  the foundation agent who shot at him  because he deemed this individual to be  worth less than the ground he stood upon  moreau asked for further clarity on how  scp-5151 determined worthiness to which  the black knight replied by quoting  escalus an ancient greek playwright  often known as the father of greek  tragedy  scp-5151 claimed there is no disease  that i spit on more than treachery and  even claimed to know escalus personally  as a good man over the course of their  conversation dr moreau was able to  convince  scp-5151 to submit to containment with  the foundation however the knight made  specific requests for his accommodation  i will need plenty of space to practice  my swordplay i will also need a retinue  to train provide me with your seven best  agents as you call them men of virtue  brave and those with reactions of a  white eagle i do not intend to deliver  my second best on any soul during  training we will train every tuesday and  every thursday we will have a grand  banquet to celebrate our training every  sunday the other days you may use my men  as you see fit good doctor comply with  my requests and you shall have a deal  good sir the night's requests were  approved by the site director of site  06-3 but before he submitted to  containment scp-51  displayed another of his anomalous  abilities the black knight requested to  make a blood pact with dr moreau and his  group of assistants the senior  researcher reluctantly agreed containing  an entity that could pass through walls  would be much easier if  scp-5151 was more cooperative after all  moreau was instructed to slice open his  hand and then accept a handshake from  the night doing so caused an anomalous  marking to form on the doctors and his  researcher's right hands at the same  time when they all held out their hands  and compared the markings they saw that  they were letters that spelled honoris  referred to by foundation researchers as  an instance of  scp-5151-2 this mark caused a notable  burning sensation for dr moreau and his  team as he made his pact with a black  knight some of the research assistants  also reported feelings of dread or  inadequacy as well as an increase in  stress levels however it is unknown  whether  scp-5151-2 causes these directly or if  these are merely side effects of this  permanent mark appearing on the skin in  order to meet the conditions of scp-5151  set for his containment the scp  foundation transferred him to a cell at  site-06-3  any and all electrical devices were  banned from use inside the cell with the  only exception being a microphone to  record audio even the light fixtures  were replaced with oil burning lamps to  give the black knights accommodation a  more medieval feel the site director  also authorized the creation of a  completely new mobile task force  designated as either mtf pi 7 or the  rather appropriate code name the honor  bound knights this unit was made up of  seven of the scp foundation's finest  operatives hand selected specifically  for their proficiency and skill in  hand-to-hand combat each member of the  honor-bound knights wasn't just to be a  skilled combatant but also needed to  create a sense of compatibility and  rapport with  scp-5151 given how much time they would  be spending around the black knight and  multiple mornings throughout the week  every member of the honor bound knights  is instructed to enter the cell of  scp-5151  over the course of the next seven long  hours the mobile task force agents will  spar and train with the black knight  scp-5151 is known to be a formidable  fighter believed to have lived for  centuries which has given him ample time  to hone his own skill with a blade every  sunday evening after they finish their  long hours of sparring a wooden table  and chairs are brought into the cell  each one of the honor bound knights will  then join scp-5151  sitting around the table with him as  they share a medieval meal foundation  personnel will provide the group with  bread pies roasted pig and poultry stews  and soups as well as wine together with  the seven members of the honor bound  nights the black knight will eat drink  and revel until he eventually passes out  then and only then are the operatives of  mobile task force pi seven permitted to  leave their seeds it would seem that the  black knight had exactly what he wanted  most a loyal group of fellow warriors to  spar against and celebrate with however  one member of the unit was noticed to be  acting strangely and was placed under  investigation he was discovered to be in  possession of several highly classified  scp foundation documents as well as  instructions to abduct an unknown scp  held in containment  site-06-3 staff believed this individual  was working on behalf of the chaos  insurgency a known group of interest the  foundation had encountered a number of  anomalous groups over its many long  years of pursuing and containing scps  among them the chaos insurgency is  perhaps the best known formed by former  members of the foundation itself the  insurgency rivals the organization they  once defected from hoping to one day  undermine and destroy it while their  knowledge of scps is more limited they  are far less restricted by rules and  regulations what the insurgency wanted  with the black knight is a mystery but  were willing to guess that they wouldn't  get on well with scp-5151  given his feelings about treachery and  should the chaos insurgency ever get  their way and manage to capture  scp-5151 they might find that capturing  him came with a price paid in blood now  go check out  scp-2273 major alexei bellatrov and  scp-1879 indoor salesman for more  strange beings from the scp foundation

